    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HURRY, FIND THE WAY OUT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four of the most dangerous inmates of Dumpyland have escaped, all the guards have been alerted: they must be captured at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become one of them, alone or with your friends, and escape from the mysterious park where you've been locked up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/71ea31ed5585932155b59fdf4f1bea3d.poster.avif?t=1748438002\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/71ea31ed5585932155b59fdf4f1bea3d.webm?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/71ea31ed5585932155b59fdf4f1bea3d.mp4?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR FIGHTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from the 4 escaped prisoners, each with a unique class, deadly abilities, and an unforgettable personality. You can even switch characters during the game to adapt your strategy to any situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/cb0aeff54cc049dc144cfa56f04660d8.avif?t=1748438002\" data-has-big width=800 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE DUNGEON, BEAT THE BOSS, ESCAPE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area of the bizarre world of Dumpyland is filled with attractions, for the prisoners\u2019 punishment and the amusement of its inhabitants. Explore the dungeons, fight your way through the guards, reach the Bosses and face them with all your might. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/886d6f3b1b6424468fff5160218ae46b.poster.avif?t=1748438002\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/886d6f3b1b6424468fff5160218ae46b.webm?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/886d6f3b1b6424468fff5160218ae46b.mp4?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DO YOU WANT MY SOUVENIRS OR NOT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn keys and coins in the abandoned Arcade and by completing Park Challenges. Spend them to get awesome Dumpyland souvenirs and unlock new abilities. Power up your characters and continue your breakout, stronger than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/a3650a87a19d95603289e028f5970b10.poster.avif?t=1748438002\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/a3650a87a19d95603289e028f5970b10.webm?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/a3650a87a19d95603289e028f5970b10.mp4?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HURRY, FIND THE WAY OUT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four of the most dangerous inmates of Dumpyland have escaped, all the guards have been alerted: they must be captured at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become one of them, alone or with your friends, and escape from the mysterious park where you've been locked up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/71ea31ed5585932155b59fdf4f1bea3d.poster.avif?t=1748438002\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/71ea31ed5585932155b59fdf4f1bea3d.webm?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/71ea31ed5585932155b59fdf4f1bea3d.mp4?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR FIGHTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from the 4 escaped prisoners, each with a unique class, deadly abilities, and an unforgettable personality. You can even switch characters during the game to adapt your strategy to any situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/cb0aeff54cc049dc144cfa56f04660d8.avif?t=1748438002\" data-has-big width=800 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE DUNGEON, BEAT THE BOSS, ESCAPE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area of the bizarre world of Dumpyland is filled with attractions, for the prisoners\u2019 punishment and the amusement of its inhabitants. Explore the dungeons, fight your way through the guards, reach the Bosses and face them with all your might. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/886d6f3b1b6424468fff5160218ae46b.poster.avif?t=1748438002\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/886d6f3b1b6424468fff5160218ae46b.webm?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/886d6f3b1b6424468fff5160218ae46b.mp4?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DO YOU WANT MY SOUVENIRS OR NOT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn keys and coins in the abandoned Arcade and by completing Park Challenges. Spend them to get awesome Dumpyland souvenirs and unlock new abilities. Power up your characters and continue your breakout, stronger than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/a3650a87a19d95603289e028f5970b10.poster.avif?t=1748438002\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/a3650a87a19d95603289e028f5970b10.webm?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/a3650a87a19d95603289e028f5970b10.mp4?t=1748438002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The four most dangerous prisoners in all of Dumpyland have escaped. Team up to take down the amusement park bosses that kept them locked away, uncover the park\u2019s twisted secrets, and fight your way to freedom in this 2D isometric adventure, solo or with your friends. Dumpy will be watching over you.",
